TI  - NF-κB- and AP-1-Mediated Induction of Human Beta Defensin-2 in Intestinal Epithelial Cells by<i>Escherichia coli</i>Nissle 1917: a Novel Effect of a Probiotic Bacterium
AU  - Jan Wehkamp
AU  - Jürgen Harder
