TI  - Bacillus clausii - The Probiotic of Choice in the Treatment of Diarrhoea
AU  - N. Jayanthi
AU  - Ratna Sudha M
JO  - Journal of Yoga & Physical Therapy
PY  - 2015
VL  - 05
